    <!-- Home switch safety (v0.2.1) -->
    <string name="dh_unsupported_google_tv">This looks like Google TV. Making BSfreeTV the Home app is not supported here: Google TV opens its own launcher directly when you press Home, and disabling that launcher can leave the device stuck restarting. You can still open BSfreeTV from your apps. If an older version changed this device, use Restore below.</string>
